  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "50d3fffecba42934",
      "translationZh": "简要概览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52bfdcc598f81710",
      "translationZh": "昨天，OpenAI 发布了 Deep Research，这是一个通过浏览网页来总结内容，并基于总结回答问题的系统。这个系统令人印象深刻，我们第一次试用时就被震撼了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a40788fde5760242",
      "translationZh": "这篇博客文章中的一项主要成果，是在 General AI Assistants 基准测试（GAIA）上的表现显著提升。我们最近也一直在尝试这个基准测试。他们成功地在 1-shot 条件下取得了平均接近 67% 的回答正确率，而在尤其具有挑战性的“level 3”问题上，正确率达到了 47.6%；这些问题涉及多步推理和工具使用（GAIA 的介绍见下文）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f904b94c671b4c30",
      "translationZh": "DeepResearch 由一个 LLM（可从 OpenAI 目前提供的 LLM 列表中选择，如 4o、o1、o3 等）和一个内部“智能体框架”组成，该框架引导 LLM 使用网页搜索等工具，并将其行动组织成多个步骤。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f06771c47b9054ca",
      "translationZh": "虽然现在已经可以免费获取强大的开源 LLM（例如最近发布的 DeepSeek R1 模型），但 OpenAI 并没有披露太多关于 Deep Research 底层智能体框架的信息……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd0a8c0fa00f7567",
      "translationZh": "因此，我们决定开启一项 24 小时的任务，复现他们的结果，并在此过程中将所需的框架开源！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c79a7559b7fc942f",
      "translationZh": "时间正在一分一秒地流逝，开始吧！⏱️",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a9360e0212a4d173",
      "translationZh": "目录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e0f0ebdc54aae13",
      "translationZh": "开源 DeepResearch——释放我们的搜索智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "50d3fffecba42934",
      "translationZh": "简要概览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
